mum regret ratio almost zero but for higher dimensions the
maximum regret ratio can be much larger (close to 25%
for the Greedy andMax-Dom-Greedy algorithms on 6D
data using k= 10). For 6D independent data (Figure 4(c)),
theGreedy andMax-Dom-Greedy algorithms are consis-
